      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m Minh (she/her) and I joined the Steen lab in Fall 2026. I&amp;rsquo;m interested in studying microbial physiology, specifically how microbes adapt to different environments as well as shape them. I&amp;rsquo;m also interested in &amp;ldquo;weird&amp;rdquo; and understudied microbes, and their evolutionary history. In my free time, I like watching movies, reading, and making music.&lt;/p&gt;
